      "name": "Finish the word",
      "tests": "5 words, each learned on its own; hear the first half, does the silence after it bring back the right word (better than the untrained twin's echo)?",
      "twin": true,
      "script": "say:apple:10:40;say:river:10:40;say:storm:10:40;say:candy:10:40;say:light:10:40;rest:300;cue:app:60;cue:riv:60;cue:sto:60;cue:can:60;cue:lig:60",
